# act_of_treason.txt: SP$ GainControl | LoseControl$ EOT | Untap$ True |
# AddKWs$ Haste. ControlGainEffect.resolve gives the Bears a timestamped
# temp controller, untaps them (Untap$), and corrects their battlefield list
# right away (controllerChangeZoneCorrection): they leave the AI's list for the
# human's, summoning sick as any new controller's permanent is. Haste is the
# keyword that lets them attack anyway.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
